            {
              "id": "GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3-tj-actions/changed-files",
              "name": "StockMatcherExactDirectMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3 high vulnerability for tj-actions/changed-files package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "tj-actions changed-files through 45.0.7 allows remote attackers to discover secrets by reading actions logs."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3\nSeverity: high\nPackage: tj-actions/changed-files\nVersion: v45\nFix Version: 46.0.1\nType: github-action\nLocation: /source/taos-community/.github/workflows/deploy-case-docs.yml\nData Namespace: github:language:github-action\nLink: [GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | tj-actions/changed-files  | v45  | 46.0.1  | github-action  | /source/taos-community/.github/workflows/deploy-case-docs.yml  | github:language:github-action  | [GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-mrrh-fwg8-r2c3)  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:github/tj-actions/changed-files@v45"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.6"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-44487-nginx",
              "name": "StockMatcherCpeMatch",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-44487 high vulnerability for nginx package"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The HTTP/2 protocol allows a denial of service (server resource consumption) because request cancellation can reset many streams quickly, as exploited in the wild in August through October 2023."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://github.com/anchore/grype",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487\nSeverity: high\nPackage: nginx\nVersion: 1.13.9\nFix Version: 1.25.3\nType: binary\nLocation: /source/taos-internal/source/plugins/web/sbin/nginx\nData Namespace: nvd:cpe\nLink: [CVE-2023-44487](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44487)",
                "markdown": "**Vulnerability CVE-2023-44487**\n| Severity | Package | Version | Fix Version | Type | Location | Data Namespace | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| high  | nginx  | 1.13.9  | 1.25.3  | binary  | /source/taos-internal/source/plugins/web/sbin/nginx  | nvd:cpe  | [CVE-2023-44487](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-44487)  |\n"
              },
